  "reason": "The strongest completed result is config_004, an RNA-only singleprofile model with scvi_n200, which outperforms PCA RNA and image-only ResNet50 in both accuracy and F1. The key uncertainty is whether multiprofile aggregation can improve this promising RNA representation. config_005 tests that directly by keeping model setting, RNA encoder, and modality fixed while changing from singleprofile to multiprofile with the simplest aggregation, avgpool. This isolates the profile/aggregation effect without introducing fusion or a new image encoder, making it the most informative next step under a limited budget."
}

